      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The issue where players joins the room but avatar itself is not showing up (name tag is visible) so i use disable/enable avatar option to make them appear. It happens very often: around 10-20% chance.\nSecond issue, perhaps related to this bug, is when i join room and noticed all players are gone, but nametags are visible. Then when i come near, some avatars flicker fast. \nRejoin room wont help, and i found out when i clear the cache, and rejoin room, they are normal. BUT wait, there is more.\nWHEN i clear cache and join immediately same room again, VRChat refuses join the room and looks it's crashed. I stay stuck in \"unload\" process of the room.\nI must leave current room by joining for example home world, and then join back to the room, no problems. Pretty strange. It has something with caching.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
